      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RED CABANG (1) jumped from a middle draw last time and could manage only fourth and beaten 4 lengths (28.92) at this track. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. RITZY RUTH (8) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when sixth at Ballarat over 390m behind Prince Laroi (22.88) in a Grade 5. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from six starts. Should be about the mark. HARD STYLE ROBBO (5) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing seventh (24.56) in a Grade 5 at this track. Form here sound including 11 wins. Warrants plenty of respect. MR. FLOOD (3) is right in the mix.",
